       (93643, 2207, 'en', 'Mandarinfisch',
        'Der Mandarinfisch ist ein kleiner Riffbewohner mit spektakulärer Farbzeichnung. Er ist eher scheu und beliebt bei Aquaristikfans. In deinem Zoo funkelt er wie ein bunter Edelstein zwischen Korallen.'),
       (93644, 30126, 'nl', 'African Wolf',
        'The African Wolf, also known as the African Golden Wolf, is a canid native to sub-Saharan Africa. It inhabits savannas, woodlands, and arid deserts. With golden-brown fur, pointed ears, and a bushy tail, it resembles a mix of wolf and jackal. It\\\'s known for its adaptability and social behavior in packs.\\n\\nIts diet mainly consists of small mammals like rodents and hares, birds, reptiles, and occasionally fruits or insects, supplemented by scavenging.'),
       (93645, 30126, 'fr', 'African Wolf',
