       (93650, 30128, 'nl', 'Bengal Fox',
        'The Bengal Fox is a small, slender fox with a narrow, pointed face, large upright ears, and a long, bushy tail tipped in black. Its coat is sandy gray to pale brown, blending well with dry grasslands and scrub habitats. The legs are relatively long and thin, giving it a light, agile look, and the eyes are dark and expressive.\\n\\nThe Bengal fox feeds on small mammals, insects, birds, reptiles, and fruits.'),
