       (93656, 30130, 'nl', 'Amethyst Starling',
        'The Amethyst Starling, also called purple starling, is a small, dazzling iridescent bird with glossy violet-purple plumage that shifts colors in sunlight, a yellow eye, and black wings/tail. They are found in woodlands and savannas of sub-Saharan Africa. Males display shimmering feathers in courtship. \\n\\nAmethyst Starling mainly eat fruits, berries, nectar, and insects like termites.\\n\\n'),
