       (93716, 30152, 'nl', 'Brahma Chicken',
        'The Brahma Chicken is a large breed known for its impressive size, gentle temperament, and distinctive feathered legs. They have a striking appearance with a broad body, a short neck, and a feathered crest, and they come in several color varieties, including light, dark, and buff. Brahma Chickens are also known for their hardiness in various climates, making them a popular choice among poultry enthusiasts.\\n\\nThe diet of Brahma Chickens should consist of high-quality layer feed, supplemented with grains, fresh vegetables and fruits, grit for digestion.\\n\\n'),
