       (93812, 30186, 'nl', 'Golden-Bellied Mangabey',
        'The Golden-Bellied Mangabey is a medium-sized Old World monkey with olive-gray upperparts, bright golden-orange fur on its belly and inner limbs, and a dark face with a pale brow ridge. Found only in the forests of the Congo River basin in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Lives in groups near riverbanks and swampy rainforests.\\n\\nGolden-Bellied Mangabey mainly eats fruits, seeds, leaves, insects, and small invertebrates. \\n\\n'),
