       (93866, 30204, 'nl', 'Leopard Tortoise',
        'The Leopard Tortoise is a large, herbivorous tortoise native to the savannas and grasslands of Africa. Characterized by its distinctive, patterned shell with yellow and black markings, it can grow up to 18 inches (0.45 meters) in length. These tortoises are known for their gentle temperament and can live for several decades. \\n\\nLeopard Tortoises primarily feed on grasses, leaves, and flowers, and require a warm, dry habitat to thrive.\\n\\n'),
