       (93944, 30230, 'nl', 'Pot-Bellied Pig',
        'The Pot-Bellied Pig is a small breed of domestic pig known for its distinctive round belly and short legs. These pigs typically weigh between 45 to 90 kilograms (100 to 200 pounds) and can live for 12 to 20 years. They have a friendly and social temperament, making them popular as pets. Pot-Bellied Pigs come in various colors, including black, white, and spotted.\\n\\nPot-Bellied Pigs require a balanced diet that primarily consists of high-quality pig pellets, fresh vegetables, and occasional fruits.\\n\\n'),
