       (93980, 30242, 'nl', 'Sawfish',
        'Sawfish are a family of rays characterized by a long, narrow, flattened rostrum, or nose extension, lined with sharp transverse teeth, arranged in a way that resembles a saw. They are among the largest fish with some species reaching lengths of about 7–7.6m (23–25 ft). Their bodies are somewhat shark-shaped, but their pectoral, or front fins, have a flat, triangular shape to them. They are found worldwide in tropical and subtropical regions in coastal marine and brackish estuarine waters, as well as freshwater rivers and lakes. All species are endangered.\\n\\nSawfish eat fish and crustaceans. The saw is key to catching and killing prey—in addition to its use as a weapon or digging tool, the saw has small pores that can detect electric fields produced by prey. \\n\\nPlayers can get up to 6 Sawfish in the same enclosure:\\n{| class=\\"article-table\\"\\n!Animals\\n! Enclosure size\\n|-\\n|1\\n|9\\n|-\\n|2\\n|9\\n|-\\n|3\\n|14\\n|-\\n|4\\n|18\\n|-\\n|5\\n|22\\n|-\\n| 6\\n|27\\n|}\\n\\n'),
